  "page": 14,
  "citation": "promotion gates are computed exclusively on the in-sample segment, and out-of-sample outcomes are never used to revise thresholds, re-rank candidates, or update the next-round search policy.",
  "sha256_pdf_recalcule": "8fe2b21770af074a0e13667048bc40b3eb85fc03ecde8f5d58938e3aa100e301",
