  "page": 16,
  "citation": "At the end of each round, the system writes a structured experiment record containing candidate definitions, metric outputs, gate outcomes, and next-step actions.",
  "sha256_pdf_recalcule": "8fe2b21770af074a0e13667048bc40b3eb85fc03ecde8f5d58938e3aa100e301",
